OL,3,GNEWSABirmingham and Wales next
OL,4,Alocations for grooming gangs inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirmingham and Wales have been
OL,7,Fannounced as the next locations for
OL,8,Flocal investigations as part of a
OL,9,Fnational inquiry into child sexual
OL,10,Fabuse by grooming gangs.
OL,12,FThe statutory inquiry, chaired by
OL,13,Fformer children's commissioner Baroness
OL,14,FAnne Longfield, is carrying out
OL,15,Ftargeted investigations in areas across
OL,16,FEngland and Wales.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
